config BR2_PACKAGE_LIBVYRO_LINUX
    bool "libvyro-linux"
    depends on BR2_TOOLCHAIN_HAS_THREADS
    select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBDRM
    select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBINPUT
    help
      The Vyro userland support library, ported to Linux.

      Provides the same window/draw/input/IPC API as the microkernel
      libvyro, implemented over Linux DRM/KMS, evdev, and musl/glibc
      syscalls. Required by every Vyro desktop application.

      https://github.com/Gaurav06120714/VyroOs
